**Title:** Auto-start countdown when the room is full

## Body
## What to build

When a room reaches capacity (4/4 players) in the `lobby` phase, the countdown starts automatically, with no Start press needed. Reduces time to start a game.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] The 4th player joining a `lobby` room starts the countdown (same path as pressing Start)
- [ ] A full room that is already in `countdown`/`playing`/`ended` is unaffected
- [ ] Test covers auto-start on the 4th join

